{"articleNo":"200046","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=200046&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[2018 국립대학 육성사업]","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.10.31","hit":"4126","attachments":[{"name":"2018년+국립대학+육성사업+지원+계획-국내사회봉사활동%2C동아리활동지원 (1).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=200046&attachNo=79341"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28px\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: dotum\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18px\">2018년 국립대학 육성사업으로 \"국내 사회봉사활동, 동아리(재능개부)봉사활동\" 신청을 안내하오니 관심있는 학생은 해당기간 내에 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28px\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28px\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: dotum\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">인원 구성&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">:&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: dotum; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"><b>5</b></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: dotum\"><b>명 이상</b>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: dotum\">사회봉사팀 및 중앙 동아리</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28px\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: dotum\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">지원 예산&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">팀별&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">1,000,000</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">원 까지 지원(1팀 한도, 1회 기준)</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28px\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: dotum\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">지원 예산은 참가인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">사업규모</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">성격 등에 따라 협의 후 조정 됨</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: dotum\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">)</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 24px\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: dotum\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">신청접수&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">:&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"COLOR: rgb(0,0,255)\">2018. 10. 31.(수</span></strong></span><strong><span style=\"COLOR: rgb(0,0,255)\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">) ~ 11. 9.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">)</span></span></strong></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 24px\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: dotum\"><strong><span style=\"COLOR: rgb(0,0,255)\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">&nbsp; - 예산 소진에 따라 조기 마감 될 수 있음</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 24px\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: dotum\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">4. 봉사종료 : 교육봉사, 재능봉사, 노력봉사 등</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 24px\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 24px\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: dotum\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\">* 문의처 : 학생처 학생지원팀 054-478-7040</span></spa